        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
        "name2": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aaaaaah!!! You...!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "How can this be... What have you done?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, don't take this personally.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, we're on a contract, you know?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "text": "When you're in a logistics business, there's nothing more important than fulfilling your contracts!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "On your left.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
